      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T21:02:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the filterability check is always the same regardless of dimension I think you could shorten this a lot by doing that first, e.g.:\n```\nif (!sa-\u003eType()-\u003eIs\u003ccore::type::F32\u003e()) {\n    return std::nullopt;\n}\nif (sa-\u003eFilterable() !\u003d core::TextureFilterable::kUnfilterable) {\n    return std::nullopt;\n}\nswitch (sa-\u003eDim()) {\n    case core::type::TextureDimension::k1d:\n        return ResourceType::kTexture1d_f32_filterable;\n    case core::type::TextureDimension::k2d:\n        return ResourceType::kTexture2d_f32_filterable;\n    ...\n```",
      "revId": "507fd2b6f7df025b88258e9186c805d03c3d49ea",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
